+        # Per-chat overrides live in two sets populated from ``_voice_mode``:
+        #   - ``_auto_tts_enabled_chats``: chat explicitly opted in via ``/voice on``
+        #     or ``/voice tts`` (mode is ``voice_only`` or ``all``). Fires even when
